3532030/extras/14c524abb4488861429bff53c8b0a414.poster.avif?t=1754424289\" width=670 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/14c524abb4488861429bff53c8b0a414.webm?t=1754424289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/14c524abb4488861429bff53c8b0a414.mp4?t=1754424289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/0db3f6bd716d63f0a791d0aa99a335ff.avif?t=1754424289\" width=616 height=40 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Stalwart Fighter using Swords and Shields or Greatswords. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/702b0228187bf82011b0ea68608b78ea.avif?t=1754424289\" width=616 height=40 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Magickal Adept using Wands and magical Orbs or Staves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/1c82aec7544e0f4abb35404bf48dbd60.avif?t=1754424289\" width=616 height=40 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Ferocious Warrior using Axes and Hatchets or Battleaxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e\u00a0<strong>Loot Transmogrifier</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trade duplicates for mythic gear.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/b0e4cfb24792e685fe2226957add2f4e.avif?t=1754424289\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude08\u00a0<strong>Boss\u202fKey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hide your dungeon with one tap.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/f180829e9d6569a746f02046dc13d42c.avif?t=1754424289\" width=800 height=401 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We get it. Sometimes you don\u2019t want someone else to see that you\u2019re playing a game. Instead of minimizing the game, hit the Boss Key! The screen will change to something more productivity friendly like a web browser with too many tabs open or a spreadsheet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Casual Windowed Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>8:3 aspect ratio fits perfectly beside work.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/4bca145ca723c4baf27c17c28387e3aa.avif?t=1754424289\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave it running while other programs and games are active. During downtime in your other games, fight, level up, and loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/2f6b21e658f88bc7824f674a65e2f627.avif?t=1754424289\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by many classic ARPG games, find randomly generated stats on items of different rarity. Find the best ones to maximize your gear and bonuses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up and Improve Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The transmogrifier will happily take your money in exchange for helping you to update the level of your item or replace bonuses to get the ultimate loot!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Magical Reforging to upgrade lower rarity items into a single higher rarity item.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell items you collect along the way that aren\u2019t useful. Take that money and do something good with it! The store gives you access to random items to supplement what you find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared inventory space between your three characters that lets you transfer items between them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532030/extras/4de16fb560a01f14d536e781bcb830eb.avif?t=1754424289\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on your own treasure hunt and collect the rarest and most valuable items. Play at your leisure with no time pressure. Save and close then come back to where you were later. The dungeon is deep, and the loot calls to you, it\u2019s time to <strong>Just Keep Looting</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cMy boss caught me playing and I was so immersed I forgot what the boss key was. I got fired. Now I\u2019m broke and homeless but it was totally worth it!\u201d</i> \u2013 Somebody Somewhere, Probably</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
